# The sdist ships the installable package, its declared package data (the
# vendored SRS schema/profiles under dagr_mcp/vendor), the license, and the
# readme. Development-only trees and provenance patches are not part of the
# distribution and are pruned so no test code or development artifact enters an
# artifact.
include LICENSE
include README.md
include CHANGELOG.md
prune tests
prune docs
prune tools
prune .github
global-exclude *.patch
